Package: lumo-defaults
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lumo OS Team <salom600@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: labwc, waybar, sddm, swaybg, swaylock, swayidle, mako-notifier, foot,
 nautilus, firefox-esr, gnome-text-editor, loupe, file-roller, mpv,
 network-manager, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber, bluez,
 mate-polkit, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, xdg-user-dirs,
 gvfs, gvfs-backends, brightnessctl, zram-tools, fonts-font-awesome,
 grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, playerctl, xwayland
Description: Lumo OS session defaults (labwc, Lumo Bar, services, policies)
 System-wide configuration that defines the Lumo Shell session: labwc
 keybindings and root menu, Lumo Bar (top bar + dock) for Waybar, SDDM
 session file, wallpaper service, lock/screenshot helpers, portal, polkit,
 sysctl, journald, zram and udev defaults, plus per-user application
 configuration skeletons.
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/salom600/lumo-os
